<Page path="start/machine">
<section id="layers">
  <h2 id="layers"><a href="#layers">Three kinds of thing</a></h2>
  <p>Everything multiversectl touches is one of three things: something the machine keeps and every universe shares, something one universe owns, or something written again from scratch on every start. Tell them apart and the rest of the tool follows.</p>
  <Figure>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 720 636" role="img" aria-labelledby="lt ld">
      <title id="lt">Three bands: what the machine keeps, what a universe owns, what is rewritten on every start</title>
      <desc id="ld">A top band holds the things there is one of per machine: the docker daemon, the image cache, the one proxy, the clones with their git objects, and the configuration directory. A middle band holds what each universe owns: worktrees, containers, app networks, volumes, its state file and its hostnames. A bottom band, drawn dashed, holds what is rewritten on every start: the routes fragment, the overlay fragment and the proxy labels.</desc>

      <rect class="d-tint-addr" x="20" y="20" width="680" height="200" rx="12"/>
      <text class="d-h" x="44" y="62">On the machine, always</text>
      <text class="d-m" x="44" y="92">one of each, however many universes run</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="44" y="112" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="147" y="141" text-anchor="middle">docker daemon</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="262" y="112" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="365" y="141" text-anchor="middle">image cache</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="480" y="112" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="583" y="141" text-anchor="middle">the one proxy</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="44" y="166" width="324" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="206" y="195" text-anchor="middle">the clones: git objects</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="380" y="166" width="306" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="533" y="195" text-anchor="middle">~/.config/multiversectl</text>

      <rect class="d-tint-num" x="20" y="240" width="680" height="200" rx="12"/>
      <text class="d-h" x="44" y="282">Each universe owns</text>
      <text class="d-m" x="44" y="312">made when it starts, gone when you remove it</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="44" y="332" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="147" y="361" text-anchor="middle">worktrees</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="262" y="332" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="365" y="361" text-anchor="middle">containers</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="480" y="332" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
      <text class="d-t" x="583" y="361" text-anchor="middle">app networks</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="44" y="386" width="206" height="44" rx="8"/>
